<p>
  {dgettext(
    "help_commands",
    "Query the audit log of all admin actions from /admin log or the Admin Console Audit Log tab. Every state-changing admin command is automatically recorded with timestamp, actor, action, and target."
  )}
</p>

<.help_h4 icon={:icon_question}>{dgettext("help_commands", "When to Use It")}</.help_h4>
<p>
  {dgettext(
    "help_commands",
    "Use it to find out who changed what on the server. For example, check who banned a user, dropped a nickname or changed a server setting."
  )}
</p>

<.help_h4 icon={:icon_code}>{dgettext("help_commands", "Syntax")}</.help_h4>
<pre>{dgettext("help_commands", "/admin log [--last N] [--user nick]")}</pre>

<.help_h4 icon={:icon_tag}>{dgettext("help_commands", "Options")}</.help_h4>
<ul>
  <li>
    <code>{dgettext("help_commands", "--last N")}</code> {dgettext(
      "help_commands",
      "— Show the last N entries (default: 20)"
    )}
  </li>
  <li>
    <code>{dgettext("help_commands", "--user nick")}</code> {dgettext(
      "help_commands",
      "— Filter to actions by a specific admin"
    )}
  </li>
</ul>

<.help_h4 icon={:icon_tab_control}>{dgettext("help_commands", "Log Entry Format")}</.help_h4>
<p>
  {dgettext("help_commands", "Each entry shows:")}
  <code>{dgettext("help_commands", "[timestamp] actor action → target_type:target_id")}</code>
</p>
<p>{dgettext("help_commands", "Common action types include:")}</p>
<ul>
  <li>
    <code>user.ban</code>, <code>user.unban</code>, <code>user.kick</code>
  </li>
  <li>
    <code>user.mute</code>, <code>user.unmute</code>, <code>user.rename</code>,
    <code>user.role</code>
  </li>
  <li>
    <code>channel.create</code>, <code>channel.delete</code>, <code>channel.purge</code>
  </li>
  <li>
    <code>ns.drop</code>, <code>ns.resetpass</code>
  </li>
  <li>
    <code>cs.drop</code>, <code>cs.transfer</code>, <code>cs.access</code>
  </li>
  <li>
    <code>server.set</code>, <code>server.info</code>
  </li>
</ul>

<.help_h4 icon={:icon_tab_control}>{dgettext("help_commands", "How It Works")}</.help_h4>
<p>
  {dgettext(
    "help_commands",
    "Entries are listed newest first. The reply starts with a header that gives the number of entries shown. When an action has extra details, they appear in brackets at the end of its line. If nothing matches, you get a line that says no entries were found."
  )}
</p>

<.help_h4 icon={:icon_rules}>{dgettext("help_commands", "Rules & Limits")}</.help_h4>
<ul>
  <li>
    {dgettext("help_commands", "You must be a server administrator and identified with NickServ")}
  </li>
  <li>
    <code>--user</code> {dgettext(
      "help_commands",
      "matches the nickname exactly, with the same upper and lower case. A leading @ is removed."
    )}
  </li>
  <li>
    {dgettext(
      "help_commands",
      "If the %{option} value is not a number, the default of 20 is used",
      option: "--last"
    )}
  </li>
  <li>
    {dgettext(
      "help_commands",
      "The log is read-only. This command does not change or delete entries."
    )}
  </li>
</ul>

<.help_h4 icon={:icon_lightbulb}>{dgettext("help_commands", "Examples")}</.help_h4>
<pre>/admin log
/admin log --last 50
/admin log --user Admin --last 10</pre>

<.help_h4 icon={:icon_link}>{dgettext("help_commands", "See Also")}</.help_h4>
<p>
  <.help_link topic="cmd-admin">{dgettext("help_commands", "/admin")}</.help_link>
  ·
  <.help_link topic="feature-admin-console">
    {dgettext("help_commands", "Admin Console")}
  </.help_link>
  · <.help_link topic="cmd-admin-server">{dgettext("help_commands", "/admin server")}</.help_link>
  ·
  <.help_link topic="feature-admin-audit-log">
    {dgettext("help_commands", "Admin Audit Log")}
  </.help_link>
</p>
